                <pb facs="0243" n="131" sameAs="frus:frus1910/pg131"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 180/64.</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The President of Chile to
                        the Third Assistant Secretary of State.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">S.
                                S. Kaiser Wilhelm der Grosse</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Via
                                wireless and Halifax</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1910-08-10"><hi rendition="#italic">August 10,
                        1910</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Repeat to you, Gen. Carter, Capt. Hulse, Mr. Dawson, best thanks for your
                    attention and kindness.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Pedro Montt.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
